    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686740/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1701703911\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Divergence is an immersive and thrilling gaming experience that transports players to a mysterious island shrouded in secrets and teeming with perilous robotic guardians. In this action-packed adventure, you'll step into the shoes of a fearless explorer armed with a unique time-reversing backpack, setting the stage for an epic quest like no other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686740/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1701703911\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Petra wields the TimeSync, a backpack that empowers her to manipulate time itself. Rewind and replay your actions, strategize, and take on your adversaries with renewed precision. The TimeSync is your key to unraveling the island's mysteries.<br></li><li>Navigate treacherous terrains, engage in heart-pounding battles, and unravel the island's secrets in stunning detail.<br></li><li>Your ultimate goal in Divergence is to face off against the formidable guardian known as the Hoplite. Defeat this formidable adversary to save the island from impending doom and retrieve the coveted Heart of Kronos, an artifact of unimaginable power.</li></ul><br>Will you have what it takes to conquer the island's challenges and uncover its hidden truths? The fate of the island rests in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2686740/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1701703911\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>This game was developed as a student project at DigiPen Institute of Technology and was created for educational purposes only. Please check out our publisher page for more information.",
